# .worktreeinclude -- gitignored files copied into each new git worktree.
# Uses .gitignore syntax. Only files that match AND are gitignored are copied;
# tracked files are never duplicated.
#
# testpage/ is gitignored but REQUIRED by the Playwright e2e suite:
# playwright.config.ts starts a webServer on ./testpage, and its index.html
# loads /dist/thumbmark.umd.js. Without it every e2e spec fails with
# "ReferenceError: ThumbmarkJS is not defined", which looks like a real
# regression but is purely a missing fixture.
testpage/
